Derived files, and changes made:

  01_chemistry_N2/data/n2_ibm_fez_samples.npz
      Measurement samples (10,000 shots, 20 qubits) from IBM's ibm_fez device,
      originally 01-quantum-chemistry/data/n2_device_bitarray.npy.
      Changed: converted from a pickled Qiskit BitArray to a pickle-free NumPy
      .npz (fields: array, num_bits). Sample values are unchanged.

  01_chemistry_N2/data/n2_ibm_fez_meta.json
      Originally 01-quantum-chemistry/data/n2_device_job_meta.json.
      Changed: added "source" and "geometry" fields.

  01_chemistry_N2/run_sqd.py
      The SQD workflow (LUCJ ansatz from CCSD amplitudes via ffsim, ffsim
      pre-init transpilation, iterative configuration recovery with
      qiskit-addon-sqd) is adapted from
      01-quantum-chemistry/notebooks/chemistry_workshop_part-1.ipynb.
      Changed: rewritten as a script; multiple molecules and bond lengths;
      MP2 amplitudes when CCSD does not converge; sampling through this
      repository's backend selector (Aer, IonQ cloud); a random-bitstring
      control; comparison with CCSD(T) and FCI.

